    "commit_body": "Score-stage multiplier on (overall - 50) when signal is within 5 trading\ndays of upcoming earnings. Calibrated per (cohort \u00d7 bucket) using\nlog-smoothed empirical WR15 lift (Phase 3B calibration table). Calls\nadmit, puts no-admit (Phase 3A.2 finding).\n\nDefaults: WINDOW=5, MAX_BOOST=0.50, LIFT_NORM_CALL=22.3, LIFT_NORM_PUT=16.3.\n\nValidated 2026-04-28 in canonical 3-mode MC (N=200, 8 windows) via\nruntime-wrapper prototype: 22-now Realistic +10,876% over shipped\nbaseline, all DD-C \u2264 80%, 0% collapse, only single-window regression\n-7.9% on 2021 (within \u00b125% gate).\n\nThis commit moves the boost from runtime-wrapper to scoring.py proper\nso DB scores match strategy semantics (API/dashboard/assessment all\nsee consistent values, explain-scores shows boost in weight_info).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
